    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather's voice on 2026-08-25 is a single decision event: mandating signed release manifests for Meridian deployments. He opens with directive force — [every Meridian deployment now requires a signed manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) — then immediately supplies the rationale, [naming two unsigned artifacts that reached staging last quarter](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) as the whole reason for the gate. The decision is then recorded in three stock-phrase items he signs as principal: the [gate itself](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), its [scope across staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), and his [ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5). The arc runs from voiced mandate to recorded artifact — formal register when issuing, plain-spoken when justifying, stock-phrase when filing. His conviction holds at decision throughout; his power moves from legitimate authority in the directive to rational-persuasion in the rationale.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Voiced expressions carry activated-negative affect while the recorded decisions shift to calm-positive — the same gate sounds different spoken vs filed." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Power mode shifts from legitimate authority in the mandate to rational-persuasion in the justification — the directive does not rest on rank alone." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "decision-stamped — speaks in mandates, not proposals; the verb is 'requires,' never 'should.'" ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "power" ; narr:reading "opens on legitimate authority, then drops to rational-persuasion to justify the same gate — rank first, evidence second." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "formal-technical when recording the decision as an artifact — the filed version is stripped of voice, pure label-and-content." ; narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
